/// PRIVACY RULE, NORMATIVE (11 §2.3): counters and gauges only — no code, no
/// paths, no hostnames, no workspace names, and no identifier beyond what
/// capture already carries. Event.session_id MUST be empty: health is
/// per-device, not per-session. tenant_id/device_id are SERVER-STAMPED from the
/// verified token. The only strings in the whole tree are version strings,
/// which are release-artifact identifiers. `conf_schema_closed_field_set`
