    /// family — a security event), "M1E-3002" (seq <= last-accepted: regression
    /// or replay; rollback is previous content under a HIGHER seq per 05 §4.6, so
    /// this check has no exception path), "M1E-3003" (transparency-log inclusion
    /// proof missing or invalid against the pinned log head), "M1E-3005" (A
    /// COMMAND STRING REACHED AN EDGE DECODER: the whole bundle is rejected,
    /// never piecewise, and one occurrence halts the rollout), "M1E-3006"
    /// (past `max_age` with the control plane unreachable — the edge falls to
    /// built-in defaults and flags verdicts `stale_cert`). All fail-static.
